SUMMARY:linkedin: Meet the paired bd
DESCRIPTION:DRAFT — importing this event does not schedule a social pos
 t.\nAsset: graphics/P01.png\n\nMeet the new BackDown mark: a lowercase b 
 and d\, paired in orange.\n\nThe pair is a useful reminder of the questio
 n behind the product: where is the other copy\, and does it contain the s
 ame data?\n\nBackDown helps you inventory drives and compare file content
 s using hashes. The current public alpha includes a command-line tool\, a
  local file browser and read-only viewers. It is an early preview\, with 
 more work ahead.\n\nOver the next month\, we'll share practical ways to t
 hink about old drives\, duplicate files and the evidence behind a backup 
 decision.\n\nJoin early access for one email when BackDown is ready.\n\nh
 ttps://backdown.io/?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_cam
 paign=bd_launch_2026_09&utm_content=p01#join\n\nPublication conditions (n
 ot part of the post):\nReview final copy and current release status.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
