BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:P04-linkedin@backdown.io
DTSTAMP:20260928T120000Z
DTSTART:20261006T083000Z
DTEND:20261006T085000Z
SUMMARY:linkedin: Put evidence behind the comparison
DESCRIPTION:DRAFT — importing this event does not schedule a social pos
 t.\nAsset: carousel/Before-you-clear-that-drive.pdf\n\nA folder name is a
  label. A content hash gives you evidence about the file itself.\n\nBackD
 own uses SHA-256 hashing when checking matching file contents. The public
  alpha includes index\, hash\, dupes and check commands\, so you can move
  from a list of files to a more informed view of where the matching copie
 s are.\n\nThat distinction matters when an archive contains renamed files
 \, repeated exports and years of copied folders. Familiar names can hide 
 different contents\; different names can point to matching data.\n\nThe r
 esult still needs to be read in the context of the drives and files you h
 ave scanned. It is evidence to inspect when planning your archive.\n\nJoi
 n early access for one email when BackDown is ready.\n\nhttps://backdown.
 io/?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=bd_launch_
 2026_09&utm_content=p04#join\n\nPublication conditions (not part of the p
 ost):\nReview final copy and current release status.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
