SUMMARY:linkedin: An inventory that stays local
DESCRIPTION:DRAFT — importing this event does not schedule a social pos
 t.\nAsset: graphics/P05.png\n\nAn archive can contain family photos\, old
  documents\, project files and records you would never publish.\n\nBackDo
 wn's local edition is built around keeping that work on your own machine.
  It needs no account and sends no telemetry. The alpha's file browser is 
 served locally\, so you can inspect the drives you have indexed without u
 ploading their contents to a hosted dashboard.\n\nThe public alpha is ava
 ilable to download without joining the website's early-access list.\n\nLo
 cal processing is useful when your first task is simply understanding the
  disks already on your desk.\n\nJoin early access for one email when Back
 Down is ready.\n\nhttps://backdown.io/?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=org
 anic_social&utm_campaign=bd_launch_2026_09&utm_content=p05#join\n\nPublic
 ation conditions (not part of the post):\nReview final copy and current r
 elease status.
