BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:P08-linkedin@backdown.io
DTSTAMP:20260928T120000Z
DTSTART:20261015T083000Z
DTEND:20261015T085000Z
SUMMARY:linkedin: The archive that started it
DESCRIPTION:DRAFT — importing this event does not schedule a social pos
 t.\nAsset: graphics/P08.png\n\nBackDown began as a one-off job: consolida
 te years of old disks into one archive and work out which drives could be
  cleared.\n\nThat founding archive contained about 27 million files. The 
 original work read and hashed 15 TB\, and uncovered 5.9 TB of duplication
  on the largest drive. An important mail archive only became clear after 
 examining the script that had backed it up.\n\nThese are results from tha
 t one archive\, not a promised saving or a benchmark for every machine.\n
 \nThe experience gave BackDown a practical focus: make the inventory insp
 ectable\, compare contents and preserve enough context to understand a re
 sult.\n\nThe public product is now an alpha. Join early access for one em
 ail when BackDown is ready.\n\nhttps://backdown.io/?utm_source=linkedin&u
 tm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=bd_launch_2026_09&utm_content=p08#j
 oin\n\nPublication conditions (not part of the post):\nReview final copy 
 and current release status.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
