BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:P10-linkedin@backdown.io
DTSTAMP:20260928T120000Z
DTSTART:20261020T083000Z
DTEND:20261020T085000Z
SUMMARY:linkedin: Help make an inventory easier to understand
DESCRIPTION:DRAFT — importing this event does not schedule a social pos
 t.\nAsset: graphics/P10.png\n\nUseful early feedback can be very small.\n
 \nA folder that is hard to recognise. A result whose wording is unclear. 
 A file preview that does not show what you expected. A question the inven
 tory leaves unanswered.\n\nBackDown's alpha is ready for that kind of scr
 utiny. It indexes drives\, checks content matches and lets you inspect re
 sults in a local browser. The people trying it can help make those result
 s easier to understand.\n\nIf you have feedback\, describe what you expec
 ted\, what happened\, your operating system and the version you tried. A 
 minimal example using non-sensitive files is especially helpful\; there i
 s no need to share your archive.\n\nWhat would you need an old-drive inve
 ntory to explain? Reply here. Join early access for one email when BackDo
 wn is ready.\n\nhttps://backdown.io/?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=organ
 ic_social&utm_campaign=bd_launch_2026_09&utm_content=p10#join\n\nPublicat
 ion conditions (not part of the post):\nReview final copy and current rel
 ease status.
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
