BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:P12-linkedin@backdown.io
DTSTAMP:20260928T120000Z
DTSTART:20261027T093000Z
DTEND:20261027T095000Z
SUMMARY:linkedin: From a drawer to an understandable archive
DESCRIPTION:DRAFT — importing this event does not schedule a social pos
 t.\nAsset: graphics/P12.png\n\nOver the past month\, we have looked at th
 e questions behind BackDown: what is on each drive\, where the other copi
 es are\, and what evidence says their contents match.\n\nThe new paired b
 d mark brings that idea into the identity. The product is still at an ear
 ly stage: the public alpha offers indexing\, hashing\, duplicate checks a
 nd local browsing\, with read-only viewers for supported files.\n\nThe ne
 xt steps will be shaped by what people find useful and what remains hard 
 to understand. A clear inventory of an old drive is a good place to start
 .\n\nIf you have a drawer of disks\, a sprawling archive or a comparison 
 you cannot quite trust\, follow this account for progress. Join early acc
 ess for one email when BackDown is ready.\n\nhttps://backdown.io/?utm_sou
 rce=linkedin&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=bd_launch_2026_09&utm
 _content=p12#join\n\nPublication conditions (not part of the post):\nRevi
 ew final copy and current release status.
